{
  "id": "E292",
  "title": "Drunken Shrimp",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2019-01-18",
  "synopsis": "What happens when Chinese people feed shrimps alcohol?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/948/dce3b2e1d11a55a9e17ac5332f2374f11cd86d54.mp3?1547295562",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "醉虾\n\n小乐：听说这家饭店的拿手菜是“醉虾”。我们尝一尝吧。\n保罗：“醉虾”？是”喝醉了的虾“吗？\n小乐：对，就是”喝醉了的虾“。\n保罗：真奇怪，虾怎么能喝醉呢？还是一道菜？\n小乐：醉虾的做法很简单。把新鲜的虾泡在白酒里10分钟左右，等虾喝饱了白酒，他们就会“睡着”。这个时候再加一些酱油、醋和辣椒就可以了。\n保罗：听上去很有意思，我们点一个吧！",
    "traditional": "醉蝦\n\n小樂：聽說這家飯店的拿手菜是“醉蝦”。我們嘗一嘗吧。\n保羅：“醉蝦”？是”喝醉了的蝦“嗎？\n小樂：對，就是”喝醉了的蝦“。\n保羅：真奇怪，蝦怎麼能喝醉呢？還是一道菜？\n小樂：醉蝦的做法很簡單。把新鮮的蝦泡在白酒裡10分鐘左右，等蝦喝飽了白酒，他們就會“睡著”。這個時候再加一些醬油、醋和辣椒就可以了。\n保羅：聽上去很有意思，我們點一個吧！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Drunken Shrimp"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：听说这家饭店的拿手菜是“醉虾”。我们尝一尝吧。",
      "traditional": "小樂：聽說這家飯店的拿手菜是“醉蝦”。我們嘗一嘗吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè tīng shuō zhè jiā fàn diàn de ná shǒu cài shì zuì xiā wǒ men cháng yì cháng ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: I heard the signature dish of this restaurant is “drunken shrimp”. Let’s try it!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：“醉虾”？是”喝醉了的虾“吗？",
      "traditional": "保羅：“醉蝦”？是”喝醉了的蝦“嗎？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó zuì xiā shì hē zuì le de xiā ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: “Drunken shrimp”? Does that mean the shrimps are drunk?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：对，就是”喝醉了的虾“。",
      "traditional": "小樂：對，就是”喝醉了的蝦“。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè duì jiù shì hē zuì le de xiā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Yes, it does refer to shrimps that have become drunk."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：真奇怪，虾怎么能喝醉呢？还是一道菜？",
      "traditional": "保羅：真奇怪，蝦怎麼能喝醉呢？還是一道菜？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó zhēn qí guài xiā zěn me néng hē zuì ne hái shì yí dào cài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: How strange! How can shrimps get drunk? And how can this be a dish?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：醉虾的做法很简单。把新鲜的虾泡在白酒里10分钟左右，",
      "traditional": "小樂：醉蝦的做法很簡單。把新鮮的蝦泡在白酒裡10分鐘左右，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè zuì xiā de zuò fǎ hěn jiǎn dān bǎ xīn xiān de xiā pào zài bái jiǔ lǐ 1 fēn zhōng zuǒ yòu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "等虾喝饱了白酒，他们就会“睡着”。",
      "traditional": "等蝦喝飽了白酒，他們就會“睡著”。",
      "pinyin": "děng xiā hē bǎo le bái jiǔ tā men jiù huì shuì zháo",
      "english": "Little Le: Drunken shrimp is very easy to cook. You put fresh shrimps in baijiu for around 10 minutes."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "这个时候再加一些酱油、醋和辣椒就可以了。",
      "traditional": "這個時候再加一些醬油、醋和辣椒就可以了。",
      "pinyin": "zhè ge shí hou zài jiā yì xiē jiàng yóu cù hé là jiāo jiù kě yǐ le",
      "english": "Wait until the shrimps are completely drunk on baijiu, and they will “fall asleep”."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "At this point, you add soy sauce, vinegar, and chili peppers, and it’s done."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "保罗：听上去很有意思，我们点一个吧！",
      "traditional": "保羅：聽上去很有意思，我們點一個吧！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó tīng shàng qu hěn yǒu yì si wǒ men diǎn yí ge ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Sounds interesting, let’s order one!"
    }
  ],
